[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/upgradeModule/text",
    "raw": "These little boxes, known as ^orange;Upgrade Modules^reset;, are extremely useful. They will allow you to upgrade your weapons and armor via your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset; as well as upgrade your ship license if using the ^yellow;Vanilla Ship^reset; option.",
    "value": "这些被称为^orange;升级模块^reset;的小盒子极为实用。它们能让你通过^orange;个人三度仪^reset;来强化武器与护甲，若选择^yellow;原版飞船^reset;选项，还可用于提升飞船执照等级。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/techCard/text",
    "raw": "Used in the creation of better tech, ^orange;Tech Cards^reset; are valuable finds that you should save for when you need to jump higher or dash farther or tuck into tiny little spheres to get through holes.",
    "value": "^orange;科技卡^reset;是打造更先进科技的关键资源，其价值非凡，值得珍藏。当你需要跳得更高、冲得更远，或是缩成小球穿越狭窄通道时，它们将成为你的得力助手。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fuMiningGun/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Mining lasers^reset; are a useful alternative to a Manipulator. They can function one-handed, and can be upgraded up to 20 times through your ^orange;Tricorder^reset;. It's worth it. They get quite powerful.",
    "value": "^orange;激光挖掘器^reset;是机械臂的一种实用替代品。它们可以单手操作，并且能够通过你的^orange;三度仪^reset;进行多达20次升级。这绝对物有所值，升级后的威力相当强大。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fuRepairGun/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Repair Guns^reset; allow you to repair your Mech in the field. They can be upgraded up to 20 times in a ^orange;Tool Upgrade Table^reset; once you build one. You'll find one in your Machining Table. It's worth it. They get quite powerful.",
    "value": "^orange;机甲修复枪^reset;能让你在现场修复机甲。一旦你建造了^orange;工具升级站^reset;，便可在其中将维修枪升级多达20次。你可以在加工台中找到它。这绝对物超所值，升级后的维修枪将变得相当强大。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fuArtifact/text",
    "raw": "This ancient relic looks quite valuable! You could sell it for exorbitant amounts of pixels...or perhaps you'll find other uses. A ^orange;Microscope^reset; might reveal more information.",
    "value": "这件古老的遗物看起来价值不菲！你可以用它换取天价的像素点...或许还能发掘其他用途。用^orange;显微镜^reset;观察或许能揭示更多信息。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupAgaranichor/text",
    "raw": "This strange substance ^orange;Fungal Ichor^reset; is fungal in nature, with a sort of sticky property that adheres to any organic matter.",
    "value": "^orange;真菌脓液^reset;这种奇特的物质，本质上是真菌性的，具有一种黏性特质，能附着在任何有机物表面。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupAmmoniumsulfate/text",
    "raw": "You'll need a fair amount of ^orange;Ammonium Sulfate^reset; in your lab work. Without it you'll be unable to produce high quality fertilizers! Research into ^orange;Chemistry^reset; will reveal more.",
    "value": "在你的实验室工作中，你将需要相当数量的^orange;硫酸铵^reset;。没有它，你将无法生产出高质量的肥料！深入研究^orange;化学^reset;将会揭示更多信息。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupFertilizer/text",
    "raw": "Without ^orange;fertilizer^reset;, you'll have a tougher time making and growing plants. It is especially useful in ^orange;Hydroponic Trays^reset;!",
    "value": "没有^orange;肥料^reset;，种植和培育植物会变得更加困难。在^orange;水培托盘^reset;中，肥料尤其重要！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupBambooshoot/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Bamboo^reset; will have little use in your lab, but it might just help you build a fancy jungle hut!",
    "value": "^orange;竹子^reset;在你的实验室里可能用处不大，但它或许能帮你搭建一座别致的丛林小屋！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupBlisterextract/text",
    "raw": "Repulsive and goopy, ^orange;Blister Sack^reset; stinks like excrement before refinement. When refined, however, it has many uses.",
    "value": "黏糊糊的^orange;泡荚^reset;未经提炼时，气味刺鼻如粪，令人作呕。然而一经提炼，却用途广泛。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupBlobbushjelly/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Putrid Slime^reset; is really quite gross. You'll find it has a few rather interesting uses through research into ^orange;Chemistry^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;腐泥^reset;确实相当恶心。不过，通过^orange;化学^reset;研究你会发现它有一些相当有趣的用途。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupCalciumnitrate/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Calcium Nitrate^reset; is an essential element in pesticides and fertilizers. You'll need some of this stuff if you plan to have a profitable farm.",
    "value": "^orange;硝酸钙^reset;是农药和化肥中的关键成分。若想经营一个盈利的农场，你需要准备一些这种物质。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupCircuitboard/text",
    "raw": "Circuitboards are essential when it comes to higher-end tech. Higher-end boards produce amazing machines. Research into ^orange;Engineering^reset; might reveal more.",
    "value": "在高端科技领域，电路板至关重要。优质的电路板能打造出卓越的机器。深入研究^orange;工程学^reset;或许能揭示更多可能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupSpareparts/text",
    "raw": "Miscellaneous pieces of metal, ^orange;Spare Parts^reset; may seem odd to collect until you consider the tungsten they can be extracted for. Try it. You'll see!",
    "value": "收集零散金属和^orange;备用零件^reset;或许看起来有些奇怪，但当你想到从中可以提取钨时，一切就说得通了。试试看吧，你会明白的！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupHydrogen/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Hydrogen^reset; gas can be applied in a variety of ways, though you'll find it best suited for ^orange;Chemistry^reset; and ^orange;Agriculture^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;氢气^reset;有多种应用方式，不过你会发现它在^orange;化学^reset;和^orange;农业^reset;领域最为适用。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupNitrogen/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Nitrogen^reset; can be found in abundance all over the place if you know where to look. You'll want a fair amount of it in your research.",
    "value": "^orange;氮气^reset;无处不在，只要知道如何寻找，便能轻易获取。在你的研究中，它将是不可或缺的重要资源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupOxygen/text",
    "raw": "Who doesn't love ^orange;Oxygen^reset;, am I right? Breathing is great! But oxygen has many other uses. Poke around in your lab and see.",
    "value": "谁不爱^orange;氧气^reset;呢，对吧？呼吸的感觉太棒了！但氧气还有许多其他用途。在你的实验室里探索一番，看看能发现什么吧。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupSalt/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Salt^reset; is quite abundant (especially in salt water) and is applied as a resource in numerous scientific branches.",
    "value": "^orange;盐^reset;资源相当丰富（尤其在咸水中），并在众多科学领域中被用作重要资源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupGeneticmaterial/text",
    "raw": "This sample of genetic material will prove to be an absolute necessity in your laboratory.",
    "value": "这份基因材料样本将在你的实验室中成为不可或缺的关键。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupIodine/text",
    "raw": "With ^orange;Iodine^reset; available, advanced medicine and methyl iodide become relatively simple to produce. I'd collect as much as you can.",
    "value": "有了^orange;碘^reset;，高级药物和甲基碘的生产就变得相对简单了。我建议你尽可能多地收集。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupMagnesiumpowder/text",
    "raw": "Take this ^orange;Magnesium Powder^reset; and use it to create advanced genes, or to help destabilize otherwise completely stable particles.",
    "value": "取此^orange;镁粉^reset;，用以合成高级基因，或协助解构原本极为稳定的粒子。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupMagnesiumsulfate/text",
    "raw": "Used primarily in medical and agricultural practices, ^orange;Magnesium Sulfate^reset; makes for a very handy additive in some intravenous drugs, or soil enrichment from fertilizers.",
    "value": "^orange;硫酸镁^reset;主要应用于医疗和农业领域，既可作为某些静脉注射药物的便捷添加剂，也能通过肥料实现土壤的养分补充。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupMethyliodide/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Methyl Iodide^reset; has but one use, and that is in the creation of pesticides. These help with hydroponics trays, producing more valuable resources.",
    "value": "^orange;甲基碘^reset;仅有一种用途，即用于制造农药。这些农药有助于水培托盘，从而生产出更有价值的资源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupMineralsample/text",
    "raw": "Strictly for lab use, mineral samples none the less prove to be essential. Without them you'll be unable to produce advanced plant life.",
    "value": "严格限于实验室使用，矿物样本的重要性不容忽视。若无它们，将无法培育出高级植物生命。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
