    "raw": "Super tough, super malleable and utterly resistant to radiation of almost all sorts, this ^orange;Mutavisk Silk^reset; can be made into great clothing and armor.",
    "value": "^orange;缪缃丝^reset;极其坚韧，又异常柔韧，几乎能抵御所有类型的辐射，非常适合用来制作优质的衣物和护甲。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupMutaviskthread/text",
    "raw": "Mutavisk silk woven into a ^orange;Bio Thread^reset;, ready for application in the lab. I think you'll be pleased with what it can do for you.",
    "value": "缪缃丝被编织成^orange;生物线^reset;，已准备好在实验室中使用。我想你会对它所能带来的效果感到满意。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupNutrientpaste/text",
    "raw": "Raw, untarnished paste created from small samples of material. This is a staple in every lab, and you'll go through a ton of it.",
    "value": "由少量材料样本制成的原始、纯净的糊状物。这是每个实验室的必备品，你会大量使用它。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupPesticide/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Pesticide^reset; is exceptionally useful for farmers, providing a simple and effective method for pest control. Research into ^orange;Chemistry^reset; will reveal more.",
    "value": "^orange;杀虫剂^reset;对农民来说极为有用，它提供了一种简单有效的害虫防治方法。深入研究^orange;化学^reset;将揭示更多可能性。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupRaptoregg/text",
    "raw": "A freakin' ^orange;DINOSAUR EGG^reset;?!??! Wow! What can we do with it, I wonder?",
    "value": "一颗^orange;恐龙蛋^reset;？！？！哇！我在想，我们能拿它做什么呢？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupRawminerals/text",
    "raw": "Another staple ingredient in the lab, raw minerals can be easily obtained from most types of stone via extraction. Stockpile as much as possible.",
    "value": "原矿是实验室的另一项基础原料，可通过从大多数类型的岩石中提取轻松获得。请尽可能多地储备。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupTissueculture/text",
    "raw": "Absolutely essential in lab work involving genetics, tissue cultures open the gate to whole new areas of experimentation.",
    "value": "在涉及遗传学的实验室工作中，组织培养技术至关重要，它为全新的实验领域打开了大门。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupBone/text",
    "raw": "You've found some ^orange;Bone^reset;. While somewhat grisly and primitive it can still produce various useful goods including weapons and armor. Access your ^green;[C]rafting^reset; menu and select the Weapons tab to make them after researching into the ^orange;Armor and Weapons^reset; tree.",
    "value": "你发现了一些^orange;骨头^reset;。虽然看起来有些阴森原始，但它们仍能用来制作各种有用的物品，包括武器和盔甲。研究完^orange;装甲和武器^reset;科技树后，进入^green;[C]制作菜单^reset;，选择武器标签页即可进行打造。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupLeather/text",
    "raw": "With ^orange;Leather^reset;, you can fashion some wonderful protection from harm or the elements. Researching ^orange;Craftsmanship^reset; should reveal more.",
    "value": "使用^orange;皮革^reset;，你可以制作出抵御伤害或恶劣天气的精良防护装备。深入研究^orange;工艺^reset;将能解锁更多可能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupSilk/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Silk^reset; is a high quality textile that has many useful applications, including high-end plastics using advanced knowledge in ^orange;Chemistry^reset;.",
