  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupGreenslime/text",
    "raw": "Slimey goop may not seem useful, until you actually use some in a lab. Imagine, armor made of slime? You can make it a reality with the right Research into ^orange;Armor and Weapons^reset;.",
    "value": "黏糊糊的黏液看似无用，直到你在实验室里真正用上它。想象一下，用黏液制成的盔甲？通过深入研究^orange;装甲和武器^reset;，你就能将这一设想变为现实。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupEndomorphicJelly/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Endomorphic Jelly^reset; is a bizarre stuff. It can be shaped very specifically with relative ease. This means weapons, armor and equipment of a most odd sort.",
    "value": "^orange;内胚层体型胶状物^reset;是一种奇异的物质。它能相对轻松地被塑造成非常具体的形态，这意味着可以制作出极其古怪的武器、护甲和装备。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupNodule/text",
