    "value": "一颗不寻常的^orange;奇异结核^reset;，其搏动带有不寻常的特征，同时携带着有机与无机的标记。在实验室环境中，它或许能发挥某种实用功能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupShoggoth/text",
    "raw": "Allright...you probably shouldn't have touched this stuff. Flesh from that hideous beast. Ew. But I am positive it will be useful.",
    "value": "好吧...你本不该碰这些东西的。那头丑陋野兽的肉块。呃。但我确信它会有用的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupMethanol/text",
    "raw": "A natural alcohol, ^orange;Methanol^reset; can be used in a variety of ways in your lab. The easiest way to obtain it is through simply placing some ^cyan;Wood^reset; in an ^orange;Extractor^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;甲醇^reset;作为一种天然醇类，在实验室中有着多种用途。获取它的最简单方法，就是直接将一些^cyan;木材^reset;放入^orange;萃取设备^reset;中进行提取。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupHelium/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Helium-3^reset; is both a fuel and energy source. It also creates an unusual effect when in large clouds, leading to hilarity in exploration.",
    "value": "^orange;氦-3^reset;既是一种燃料，也是一种能源。当它在大规模云团中聚集时，还会产生一种奇特的效果，为探索过程增添了不少乐趣。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupShadowgas/text",
    "raw": "This vile ^orange;Caliginous Gas^reset; really screws up your movement ability within it due to neurological effects that permeate even specially treated membranes, and can cause long-term damage to the psyche and immune system.",
    "value": "这种恶毒的^orange;暗影气体^reset;甚至能渗透特殊处理过的防护膜，对神经系统产生影响，严重干扰你在其中的行动能力，并可能对心理和免疫系统造成长期损害。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupCorvex/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Corvex^reset; is a laboratory miracle. It can allegedly bind certain elements at a sub-atomic level and create entirely new sorts of physics as a result.",
    "value": "^orange;科维克斯粘合剂^reset;堪称实验室奇迹。据称，它能在亚原子层面结合特定元素，从而创造出全新的物理现象。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupKoanite/text",
